  "summary": "linkify-it is a links recognition library with full Unicode support. Prior to 5.0.2, the mailto: schema validator used…",
  "details": "linkify-it is a links recognition library with full Unicode support. Prior to 5.0.2, the mailto: schema validator used by .test() and .match() can be invoked at every mailto: occurrence and scan the remaining input through src_email_name in lib/re.mjs, causing O(n^2) CPU consumption on crafted user text. This issue is fixed in version 5.0.2.",
